<title>USA: Florida to sell $189.84 mln GOs on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Florida to sell $189.84 mln GOs on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida Board of Education will sell $189.84 million of general obligation bonds by competitive bid at 1100 EST on Wednesday, the state Division of Bond Finance said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The issue is designated State Board of Education Capital Outlay Bonds, 1997 series A.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
